1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,109
The words you must use exactly.

2
00:00:02,109 --> 00:00:04,153
A gene sits at a locus.

3
00:00:04,153 --> 00:00:05,820
Its forms are alleles.

4
00:00:05,820 --> 00:00:10,911
Dominant is expressed in the heterozygote, recessive is masked.

5
00:00:10,911 --> 00:00:15,911
Homozygous means both alleles alike, heterozygous means different.

6
00:00:15,911 --> 00:00:20,195
Genotype is the genetic make up, phenotype the appearance.

